# Keep the Docker build context small and avoid copying host-built artifacts
# (which are Windows-built here and would break the Linux image).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/uploads
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/web/tests
DEMO
design-system
*.md
!README.md
.claude
.vscode
